"%d mask(s) don't match the %dx%d resolution the images use: %s. Semantic-segmentation masks are pixel-wise label maps, so each mask must be exactly the image size — the cluster validates this after the upload. Resize the masks to match and re-run."
"%d mask(s) in masks/ can't be ingested: %s. The cluster reads every mask as a PNG and rejects these after the upload — fix or remove them and re-run."
